/citations></technical-data> <parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KONDO TETSUJIRO</name> <address><country>JP</country> </address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAYA HIDEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAWAO TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SONY CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KONDO, TETSUJIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAYA, HIDEO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAWAO, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KONDO TETSUJIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAYA HIDEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAWAO TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KONDO, TETSUJIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAYA, HIDEO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAWAO, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>From an image signal generated by a CCD image sensor, a class tap and a prediction tap are extracted by a blocking section (28) of an image signal processor (25). The class tap is outputted to an ADRC processing section (29) and the prediction tap is outputted to an adapting section (31). The ADRC processing section (29) generates feature information by ADRC-processing the received image signal. A class sorting section (30) generates a class code corresponding to the feature information and supplies to the adapting section (31). The adapting section (31) reads the predication coefficient set corresponding to the class code from a coefficient set memory (32), and generates all the R, B, and G chromatic signals for the position of the pixel being a processing object.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un prélèvement de classe et un prélèvement de prédiction sont extraits, par une section de formation (28) de blocs d'un dispositif de traitement (25) de signaux d'images, d'un signal d'image produit par un capteur d'images CCD. Le prélèvement de classe est envoyé à une section de traitement (29) ADRC et le prélèvement de prédiction est envoyé à une section d'adaptation (31). La section de traitement (29) ADRC produit des informations de caractéristiques par le traitement ADRC du signal d'image. Une section de tri (30) de classe produit un code de classe correspondant aux informations de caractéristiques et l'envoie à la section d'adaptation (31). La section d'adaptation (31) lit la série de coefficients de prédiction correspondant au code de classe dans une mémoire (32) contenant les séries de coefficients et produit tous les signaux chromatiques R, V et B pour la position du pixel en cours de traitement.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights 